{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09026","headline":"独游西斋寄崔主簿 · 韦应物","name":"独游西斋寄崔主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同心忽已别，昨事方成昔。\n幽径还独寻，绿苔见行迹。\n秋斋正萧散，烟水易昏夕。\n忧来结几重，非君不可释。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗品彚（附唐诗拾遗）》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩品彚_(四庫全書本)）"}